  <p id="c-songshu-081-xuanmo-liuxiuzhi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-081-xuanmo-liuxiuzhi:p001:m0000" ref="qkm_hps_nmk_AA">劉秀之</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-081-xuanmo-liuxiuzhi:p001:m0004" ref="qkm_hps_nmk_AA">道寶</persName>，東莞莒人，司徒<persName id="c-songshu-081-xuanmo-liuxiuzhi:p001:m0014" ref="255_233_b52">劉穆之</persName>從兄子也。世居京口。祖<persName id="c-songshu-081-xuanmo-liuxiuzhi:p001:m0028" ref="qkm_hps_nmk">爽</persName>，尚書都官郎，山陰令。父<persName id="c-songshu-081-xuanmo-liuxiuzhi:p001:m0041" ref="qkm_hps_nmk_A">仲道</persName>，</p>
